 "remarks": "Freshly painted and professionally cleaned, this townhouse is ready for its new tenants. Newer and spacious Townhouse in the heart of downtown Stamford! Three large bedrooms and three full and one half bathrooms. Hardwood floors on the main level and plush carpeting in the bedrooms. Luxury appliances, gas heat and cooking, city sewer, city water. Sliders from Dining area to deck. Laundry on 2nd floor. Park your cars in the 2 car garage and walk to downtown restaurants, theatre and shopping!",
